### Create transfer
POST http://localhost:8081/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountId": 1,
  "toAccountId": 2,
  "amount": 500.00,
  "description": "Test transfer"
}

### Get transfer by ID
GET http://localhost:8081/api/transfers/1

### Get all transfers
GET http://localhost:8081/api/transfers